### note: this is a test file for api calls with the VScode RestClient extension

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

### Check backend health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Get all test entries
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/test-entries

### Create a test entry
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/test-entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "Hello from REST Client"
}

### Create a user entry
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Max"
}
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user

### Better Auth health
GET http://localhost:4000/api/auth/ok


### Register a user using betterauth
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/sign-up/email
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000

{
  "name": "TestUser3",
  "email": "testuser2@example.com",
  "password": "MySecurePassword123!"
}

###
GET http://localhost:4000/api/auth/list-accounts

### delete user
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/delete-user
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000

{
  "password": "MySecurePassword123!"
}